On evAfter
	Calculate cSourcePath as $cinst.$shortPath(cSourcePath) ## any of the four fronts; a path that does not resolve stays as typed
	Set reference iSourceRef to iTools.$pathToRefQuiet(cSourcePath) ## silent, reads Lib.Class, and agrees with the colour $redrawPathField gives the field
	Do $cinst.$logSetValues()
	Do $cfield.$redraw()
	
On evKey
	If pSystemKey=kTabKey&#SHIFT
		Queue set current field efTargetPath
	Else If pSystemKey=kTabKey
		Queue set current field efFindScriptText
	End If